Scope of this licence

The MIT grant above covers AEO's own work: everything in this repository
except `source/`, which is to say `plugin/`, `.claude-plugin/`, `docs/`,
`tests/`, `evals/`, `logs/` and the root files. It does not cover `source/`,
which is a verbatim reference snapshot of other trees, kept for provenance and
governed by their own terms rather than by this licence. `source/axial/` is
copied from a repository published under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0.
`source/upstream-red-green-refactor/` is upstream work under its own MIT
licence, with that licence file in place; the five skills derived from it under
`plugin/` carry the same notice in `plugin/UPSTREAM-LICENSE`. Where a subtree
under `source/` carries its own licence file, that file governs.
